# CLARION CALL: the three goals. Beacon: get the Homing Charm (here bought
# at the Arboretum's stall for 100, with real presses). Saucer: fly out of
# the Carillon, Ansel or no Ansel (any win over Lady Hush earns it: the
# goal line asks "ANSEL TOO?", and the bad ending, Cogtown's shortcut and
# an engine left standing, counts too). Alien: stop Grandsire Tock (it
# earns the Saucer too). Goals are kept for good.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 10
expect goals == 0
cheat area 1 0
wait 2
cheat coins 150
cheat enter_room 8
wait 2
expect item_a0 == 11
expect item_price0 == 100
cheat sub_place 136 144
wait 5
press B 10
wait 30
expect has11 == 1
expect coins == 50
expect goals == 1
reload
game clarion
wait 10
expect goals == 1
# the Saucer, by the lonely way: an engine left standing
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat engines 3
cheat escape 1
wait 2
cheat place 160 30
hold B 30
wait 2
expect ending == 1
expect goals == 3
# then the Alien
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat escape 3
wait 2
cheat place 160 30
hold B 30
wait 2
expect goals == 7
